  "description": "I found myself back in that horrific spring.\nThe season when the countess drained my blood in the name of a ritual, and when I suffered endless abuse without even knowing my mother had already died.\n\nIn my previous life, the person who pulled me out of that living hell was the cursed Grand Duke, Kallian Orpheus.\nOur contract marriage began with a simple bargain: he would save me from the count’s estate, and in return, I would ease the madness that tormented him.\n\nWhat began as a calculated arrangement slowly became something more.\nI fell in love with him.\nThose days were the happiest of my life, even though the countess’s curse eventually led me to a miserable end.\n\nIf I want to uncover the truth behind my mother’s death and my own, I must escape that estate once again.\nAnd as an illegitimate child with no power of her own, I have only one choice.\n\n*\"Just one more time… may I lean on you?\"*  \nFalling in love with you was never part of the plan. At least, not in this life.\n\n\n\n_Source:  [Kakao Page](https://page.kakao.com/content/69291932), translated_\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \nR19: [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/69291932), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EC%A0%80%EC%A3%BC%EB%B0%9B%EC%9D%80-%EB%8C%80%EA%B3%B5%EC%9D%98-%EC%95%84%EB%82%B4%EA%B0%80-%EB%90%98%EC%97%88%EB%8B%A4-19%EC%84%B8-%EC%99%84%EC%A0%84%ED%8C%90/4871)  \nR15: [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/69291938)",
